  - m_Id: 44472447524864
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45900792586240
    m_Localized: Silas... help me... forest...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46268440109056
    m_Localized: Please... come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47891015000064
    m_Localized: Message Box > Mara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49094574727168
    m_Localized: (This door... is locked?)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 49548490694656
    m_Localized: Today
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51163360649216
    m_Localized: 1 Text Message
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 51361101111296
    m_Localized: MESSAGES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 206804678479872
    m_Localized: ' Mara... if you''re here... give me a sign.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 217826734772224
    m_Localized: Nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 254023846727680
    m_Localized: Hope you're okay...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 254311936692224
    m_Localized: Campfire... the campfire. She mentioned it. I need to go there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 218746474336256
    m_Localized: I need to follow her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 218138795184128
    m_Localized: The cave... what are you doing, Mara?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 254815790043136
    m_Localized: She wants me go back... but why?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 419830011256832
    m_Localized: ...What happened here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420081103265792
    m_Localized: Is that... coming from above?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420281037348864
    m_Localized: Mara... are you there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420405989859328
    m_Localized: " No\u2026 no\u2026 Mara\u2026 no!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 606027160883200
    m_Localized: Him...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 606148724396032
    m_Localized: Who is "him"...?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629111947399168
    m_Localized: "The voices won't stop...\n\nThey say I must find something, that
      only\nthen everything will end.\n\nThey say I must find something, \nthat only
      then everything will end.\n\nIf you find me, don't come close.\n\nI'm not the
      same anymore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629158852300800
    m_Localized: Note found in the cabin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629426948018176
    m_Localized: "I've seen things you wouldn't understand.\n\nThey watch me, they
      guide me, \nthey show me the truth.\n\nYou've always been weak, but I...\n\nI'm
      learning to be strong.\n\nSoon you'll understand."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629451044294656
    m_Localized: Note found in the cave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629468895252480
    m_Localized: 'I don''t want you to suffer, that''s why

      I pushed you away.


      You''ll
      never understand,

      but this power is mine-it always was.


      When
      the time comes, you''ll have to choose:

      follow me... or disappear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629488889499648
    m_Localized: Note found in the campfire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 634508829659136
    m_Localized: Flashlight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 634707073437696
    m_Localized: Press Interact to read
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1052137399246848
    m_Localized: (It's dark outside, I need a flashlight...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1100389322579968
    m_Localized: Move
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1176303356076032
    m_Localized: (I'm getting tired...)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
